a, the reservoir of all pleasure. In the First Canto of }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 \'c7r\'e9mad}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 Bh\'e4gavatam}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 
