Even the very question is so nice that it is the best subject matter for hearing. Simply by such questioning and hearing, one can achieve the highest perfectional stage of life. Because Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the o
riginal Supreme Person, any question about Him is original and perfect. Lord }{\insrsid5596316\charrsid4139932 \'c7r\'e9}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787  Caitanya }{\insrsid5596316\charrsid4592098 Mah\'e4prabhu}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 
 said that the highest perfection of life is to achieve transcendental loving service of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Because questions and answers about K\'e5\'f1\'eba elevate one to that transcendental position, the questions of Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Par\'e9k\'f1it about K
\'e5\'f1\'eba philosophy are greatly glorified. Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Par\'e9k\'f1it wanted to absorb his mind completely in K\'e5\'f1\'eba, and such absorption can be effected simply by hearing about the uncommon activities of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. For instance, in the }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid4592098 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787  it is stated that simply by understanding the transcendental nature of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a's appearance, disappearance, and activities, one can immediately return back to home, back to Godhead, and never come back to this miserable condition of material existence. It is very auspicious, therefore, to hear always about K\'e5\'f1\'eba. So Mah
\'e4r\'e4ja Par\'e9k\'f1it requested \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 to narrate the activities of K\'e5\'f1\'eba so that he could engage his mind in K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The activities of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a are nondifferent from Himself. As long as one is engaged in hearing such transcendental activities of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, he remains aloof from the conditional life of material existence. The topics of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a are so auspicious that they purify the speaker, the hearer, and the inquirer. They are compared to the Ganges waters, which flow from the toe of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. Wherever the Ganges waters go, they purify the land and the person who bathes in them. Similarly, }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid4592098 K\'e5\'f1\'eba-kath\'e4}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787  or the topics of K\'e5\'f1\'eba are so pure that whe
rever they are spoken, the place, the hearer, the inquirer, the speaker and all concerned become purified.
\par }{\insrsid5596316 
\par }\pard \qc \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5596316 {\insrsid5596316\charrsid8139127 TEXT}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787  2
