\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 older's life. One is }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 g\'e5hastha}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 , and the other is }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 g\'e5hamedh\'e9}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 . The }{
\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 g\'e5hasthas}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787  are those who live together with wife }{\insrsid5596316 and children, but live transcen}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 dentally for realizing the ultimate truth. The }{
\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 g\'e5hamedh\'e9s}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 , however, are those who live only for the benefit of the family members, extended or centralized, and thus are envious of others. The word }{
\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 medh\'e9}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787  indicates jealousy of others. The }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 g\'e5hamedh\'e9s}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 
, being interested in family affairs only, are certainly envious of others. Therefore, one }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 g\'e5hamedh\'e9}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787  is not on good terms with another }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 g\'e5ha
medh\'e9}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 
, and in the extended form, one community, society or nation is not on good terms with another counterpart of selfish interest. In the age of Kali, all the householders are jealous of one another because they are blind to the knowledge of ultimate tru
th. They have many subject matters for hearing, namely political, scientific, social, economic and so on, but due to a poor fund of knowledge, they set aside the question of the ultimate miseries of life, namely miseries of birth, death, old age and disea
se. Factually, the human life is meant for making an ultimate solution to birth, death, old age and disease, but the }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid1788405 g\'e5hamedh\'e9s}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 
, being illusioned by the material nature, forget everything about self-realization. The ultimate solution of the problems of life is to go back to home, back to Godhead, and thus, as stated in the }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid4592098 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 , the miseries of material existence\emdash birth, death, old age and disease-are removed. (Bg. 8.16)
