\'f1\'eba, and as such he had no business to inquire from \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 about where and how to apply the mind in the impersonal }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid12804399 vir\'e4\'f6}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787  }{
