ress of time, and, therefore, He knows all about the past and future, along with His present activities. There is nothing unknown to Him. The conditioned souls are driven by the reactions of the modes of material nature, which are the activities of the Lo
rd. As it is stated in the }{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid4592098 Bhagavad}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid5596316\charrsid2833115 g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid5596316\charrsid16332787 
