\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1641936 {\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 The functions of the mind are thinking, feeling, and willing. When the mind is materialistic, or absorbed in 
