ental plane. The influence of time is exhibited by the symptoms of birth, death, old age and disease, and these four principles
 of material conditions are present everywhere in any part of the material cosmos up to the planet Brahmaloka, where the duration of life of the inhabitants appears to us to be fabulous. Insurmountable time even brings about the death of }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 Brahm\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , so what to speak of other demigods like Indra, Candra, }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 S\'fcrya}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 V\'e4yu
