, }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid10362719 j\'ef\'e4na}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid10362719 yoga}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  and }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12809927 bhakti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid10362719 yoga}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , but one can reach the }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid8853621 Vaiku\'eb\'f6ha}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  planets by the practice of }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12809927 bhakti}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid10362719 yoga}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  only. The other two are incompetent in helping one to reach the }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 Vaiku\'eb\'f6halokas}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , although they can, however, conveniently take one to the effulgent }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , as described above.
