only dependable friend and well-wisher. They do not care for any mundane creature up to the status of }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 Brahm\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
, the lord of the universe. They only can definitely have a clear vision of the }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid8853621 Vaiku\'eb\'f6ha}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  planets. Such pure devotees, being perfectly directed by th
