 (Bg. 14.27) it is clearly said that the impersonal }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  rests on the person of the Lord, and because everything rests on the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{
