he condition is that one should be completely freed from desire for material enjoyment. There are different grades of material enjoyments in respect to duration of life and sensual gratification. The highest plane of sensual enjoyment for the longest peri
od of life is mentioned in the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
 (Bg. 9.20). All are but material enjoyments, and one should be thoroughly convinced that he has no need of such long duration of life, even in the Brahmaloka planet. He must return home, back to Godhead, and must
 not be attracted by any amount of material facilities. In the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
 (Bg. 2.59) it is said that this sort of material detachment is possible to attain when one is acquainted with the supreme association of life. }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7092309 Para\'e0 d\'e5\'f1\'f6v\'e4 nivartate}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
. One cannot b
e freed from material attraction unless he has complete understanding of the nature of spiritual life. The propaganda by a certain class of impersonalists that spiritual life is void of all varieties is dangerous propaganda to mislead the living beings in
to becoming more and more attracted by material enjoyments. As such, persons with a poor fund of knowledge cannot have any conception of the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid13766508 param}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 ; }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 they try to stick to the varieties of material enjoyments, although they may flatter themselves to be }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid14252554 Brahman}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
-realized souls. Such less intelligent persons cannot have any conception of the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid13766508 param}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , as mentioned in this verse, and there}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid1788405 f}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 ore they cannot reach the Supreme. The devotees have full knowledge of the spiritual world, the Personality of Godhead and His transcendental association in unlimited spiritual planets called }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 Vaiku\'eb\'f6halokas}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 . Herein }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7092309 aku\'eb\'f6ha}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid13401596 d\'e5\'f1\'f6i\'f9}{
