 is the torchlight by which to see the real path. }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid6713121 \'c7r\'e9la}{\insrsid1641936  }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid946729 J\'e9va}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 Gosv\'e4m\'e9}{
