the purview of the material world cannot be an expert in every type of materially enjoyable asset, but one can have considerable influence over a particular matter by worshiping a particular demigod, as mentioned above. }{\insrsid1641936 R\'e4va\'eba}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  was made a very powerful man by worshiping Lord }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid3027206 \'c7iva}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , and he used to offer severed heads to please Lord }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid3027206 \'c7iva}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 . He became so powerful by the grace of Lord }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid3027206 \'c7iva}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  that all the demigods were afraid of him, until he at last challenged the Personality of Godhead }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 \'c7r\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  }{\insrsid1641936 R\'e4macandra}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  and thus ruined
 himself. In other words, all such persons who aspire after gaining some or all of the material objects of enjoyment, or the gross materialistic persons, are on the whole less intelligent, as it is confirmed in the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 
