 because it contains the messages of the Lord and His pure devotees. Death is inevitable for everyone, intelligent and foolish. But Par\'e9k\'f1it Mah\'e4r\'e4ja has been addressed by the }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 Gosv\'e4m\'e9}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  as the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid5392925 man\'e9\'f1\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
, or the man of highly developed mind, because at the time of death he left all material enjoyment and completely surrendered unto the lotus feet of the Lord by hearing His messages from the right person, like \'c7ukadeva }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 Gosv\'e4m\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 . But aspiration for material enjoyment by endeav}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid2833115 o}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
ring persons is condemned. Such aspirations are something like the intoxication of the degraded human society. Intelligent persons should try to avoid it and seek instead the permanent life by returning home, back to Godhead.
