selfishness must be aimed at the point of going back to Godhead. The ass does not know his self-interest, and it works very hard for others only. Similarly, a person who works very hard for others only, forgetting his personal interest available in the hu
man form of life, is compared to the ass. In the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid9374961 Brahm\'e4-vaivarta}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid9374961  }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid9374961 Pur\'e4\'eba}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid9374961  it is said:
