otherwise, before His liberation, he was simply a son of a maidservant. The questions may be asked why }{\insrsid1641936 N\'e4radaj\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  was not aware of the Supreme Lord and why he misconceived }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid12613802 Brahm\'e4j\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  as the Supreme Lord, although factually he was not so. A liberated soul is never bewildered by such a mistaken idea, so why did }{\insrsid1641936 N\'e4radaj\'e9}{
