\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , and by character study Mah\'e4r\'e4ja }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4604580 Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  was a better moralist than Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba asked Mah\'e4r\'e4ja }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid4604580 Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  to lie, but Mah\'e4r\'e4ja }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4604580 Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  protested. But that does not mean that Mah\'e4r\'e4ja }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid4604580 Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  could be equal to Lord }{\insrsid1641936 R\'e4macandra}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  or Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The great authorities have estimated Mah\'e4r\'e4ja }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid4604580 Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  to be a pious man, but they have accepted Lord }{\insrsid1641936 R\'e4ma}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  or K\'e5\'f1\'eb
