\par }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 "I serve the Supreme Personality of Godhead Govinda, the primeval Lord whose effulgence of His transcendental body, known as the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
, unlimited, unfathomed and all-pervasive, is the cause of the creation of unlimited numbers of planets, etc., with varieties of climates and specific conditions of life."
\par The same statement is in the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 Bhagavad}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid2833115 g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  (Bg. 14.27). Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the background of the }{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  (}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid2231958 brahma\'ebe}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid13907137 hi}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  }{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7802212 prati\'f1\'f6h\'e4ham}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 ). In the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7802212 Nirukti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , or Vedic dictionary, the import of }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7481589 
prati\'f1\'f6h\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  is mentioned as that which establishes. So the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  is not independent or self-sufficient. Lord }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 \'c7r\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  K\'e5\'f1\'eba is ultimately the creator of the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , mentioned in this verse as }{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid3496502 sva}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7802212 roci\'f1\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , or the effulgence of the transcendental body of the Lord. This }{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  is all-pervading, and all creation is made possible by its potential power}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 ; }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
therefore the Vedic hymns declare that everything that exists is being sustained by the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  (}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7802212 sarva\'e0 khalv ida\'e0 brahma}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 ). Therefore the potential seed of all creation is the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , and the same }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , unlimited and unfathomed, is established by the Lord. Therefore the Lord (}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 \'c7r\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  K\'e5\'f1\'eba) is ultimately the supreme cause of all creation (}{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7802212 aha\'e0 }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid15878533 sarvasya}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7802212  prabhava\'f9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 ).
\par One should not expect the Lord to create like the blacksmith with a ha}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid2833115 m}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 mer and other instruments. The Lord creates by His potencies. He has His multifarious potencies (}{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7802212 par\'e4sya \'e7aktir vividhaiva \'e7r\'fcyate}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
). Just as the small seed of a banyan fruit has the potency to create a big banyan tree, similarly the Lord disseminates all varieties of seeds by His potential }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  (}{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid3496502 sva}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7802212 roci\'f1\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 ), and the seeds are made to develop by the watering process of persons like }{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 Brahm\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 . }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 Brahm\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
 cannot create the seeds, but he can manifest the seed into a tree, just as a gardener helps the plants and orchards to grow by the watering process. 
The example cited here of the sun is very appropriate. In the material world the sun is the cause of all illumination: fire, electricity, the rays of the moon, etc. All luminaries in the sky are creations of the sun, the sun is the creation of the }{
\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , and the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12607637 brahmajyoti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  is the effulgence of the Lord. Thus the ultimate cause of creation is the Lord.}
