life also increases, and one can have control over death also by such practices. A perfect }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid6572069 yog\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
 can have command over death and quit the body at the right moment, when he is competent to transfer himself to a suitable planet. The }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid12809927 bhakti}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid6572069 yog
\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , however, surpasses all the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid1071071 yog\'e9s}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
 because, by dint of his devotional service, he is promoted to the region beyond the material sky, and he is placed in one of the planets in the spiritual sky by the supreme will of the Lord, the controller of everything.
