, or the renounced persons, cannot break the vow of celibacy if they want success in the process. The }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid9333599 brahmac\'e4r\'e9s}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid5712387 v\'e4naprasthas}{
