e imagination of a materialistic demon like }{\insrsid1641936 Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , and thus, keeping pace with the benediction of }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid12613802 Brahm\'e4j\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
