od, gradually become puffed up by material acquisitions and begin to challenge the authority of the Supreme Lord and torture those who are devotees of the Lord. }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid8477311 Prahl\'e4da}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja happened to be the son of }{\insrsid1641936 Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , and because he was a great devotee, his father tortured him to the best of his ability. In this extreme situation, the Lord assumed the incarnation of }
{\insrsid1641936 N\'e5si\'e0hadeva}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , and just to finish the enemy of the demigods, the Lord killed }{\insrsid1641936 Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
 in a manner which was beyond the demon's imagination. Materialistic plans of godless demons are always frustrated by the all-powerful Lord.
