e best use of such possessions is to engage them in the service of the Lord so that the Lord may be pleased with him and award him a permanent place in His }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid7092309 para\'e0 dh\'e4ma}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 .
