\par }\pard \qj \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1641936 {\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
One cannot manufacture a God by one's mental speculation or by numerical votes, as has become a practice for the less intelligent class of men. God is God eternally, and an ordinary living entity is eternally a part and parcel of God. 
God is one without a second, and the ordinary living entities are many without number. All such living entities are maintained by God Himself, and that is the verdict of the Vedic literatures. When K\'e5\'f1\'eba was on the lap of His mother, the demon }{
\insrsid1641936 P\'fctan\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  appeared before His mother and prayed to nurture the child in her lap. Mother }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
 agreed, and the child was transferred onto the lap of }{\insrsid1641936 P\'fctan\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , who was in the garb}{\insrsid1641936  }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 of a respectable lady. }{\insrsid1641936 P\'fctan\'e4}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  wanted to kill the child by smearing poison on the nipple of her
 breast. But when everything was complete, the Lord sucked her breast along with her very air of life, and the demon's gigantic body, said to be as long as six miles, fell down. But Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a did not need to expand Himself to the length of the she-demon }{\insrsid1641936 P\'fctan\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , although He was quite competent to extend Himself more than six miles long. In His }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid8853621 V\'e4
mana}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  incarnation He posed Himself as a dwarf }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid946729 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , but when He took possession of His land, promised by Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja, He expanded His footstep to the top end of the universe, extending over thousands and millions of miles. So it was not very difficult for K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a to perform a miracle by extending His bodily feature, but He had no desire to do it because of His deep filial love for His mother, }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 . If }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  would have seen K\'e5\'f1\'eba in her lap extending six miles to cope with the she-demon }{\insrsid1641936 P\'fctan\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , then the natural filial love of }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  would have been hurt because in that way }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  would come to know that her so-called son, K\'e5\'f1\'eba, was God Himself. And with the know
ledge of the Godhead of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4may\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  would have lost the temper of her love for K\'e5\'f1\'eba as a natural mother. But as far as Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a is concerned, He is God always, either as a child on the lap of His mother, or as the coverer of the universe, }{\insrsid1641936 V\'e4manadeva}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
. He does not require to become God by undergoing severe penances, although some men think of becoming God in that way. By undergoing severe austerities and penances, one cannot become one or equal with God, but one can attain most of the godly qualities
. A living being can attain godly qualities to a large extent, but he cannot become God}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 ; }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 whereas K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, without undergoing any type of penance, is God always, either in the lap of His mother or growing up or at any stage of growth.
\par So at the age of only three months He killed the }{\insrsid1641936 \'c7aka\'f6\'e4sura}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  who remained hidden behind a cart in the house of }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4may\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
. And when He was crawling and was disturbing His mother from doing household affairs, the mother tied Him with a grinding pestle, but the naughty child dragged the pestle up to a pair of very high }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid6241216 arjuna}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  trees in the yard of }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4may\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , and when the pestel was stuck in between the pair of trees, they fell down with a horrible sound. When }{\insrsid1641936 Ya
\'e7od\'e4may\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  came to see the happenings, she thought that her child was saved
 from the falling trees by the mercy of the Lord, without knowing that the Lord Himself, crawling in her yard, had wreaked the havoc. So that is the way of reciprocation of love affairs be}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid1788405 t}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 ween the Lord and His devotees. }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4may\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  wanted to have the Lord 
as her child, and the Lord played exactly like a child in her lap, but at the same time played the part of the Almighty Lord whenever it was so required. The beauty of such pastimes was that the Lord fulfilled everyone's desire. In the case of felling the
 gigantic }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid11236717 arjuna}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  tree, the Lord's mission was to deliver the two sons of Kuvera, who were condemned to become trees by the curse of }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid946729 N\'e4rada}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , as well as to play like a crawling child in the yard of }{\insrsid1641936 Ya\'e7od\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 , who took transcendental pleasure in seeing such activ
ities of the Lord in the very yard of her home.
\par The Lord in any condition is Lord of the universe, and He can act as such in any form, gigantic or small, as He likes.
