 (Bg. 9.25), persons trying to qualify themselves for promotion to the higher regions of heavenly planets can go there}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 ; }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 similarly, persons trying for the }{\insrsid1641936 Pit\'e5lokas
}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  can go there}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 ; }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
