 was a pure devotee of the Lord, and thus without any effort on his part the Lord saved him from the wrath of }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid6502827 Yoge\'e7vara}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid6956768 Durv\'e4s\'e4}{
