s stated in the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  (Bg. 15.15), the whole purport of all the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid6709237 Vedas}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 
