n one think of the Lord as being without form? How can one become formless and at the same time have all intelligence and consciousness, direct and indirect? So there are many things for a pure devotee to learn, and he should learn them perfectly from a b
ona fide personality like \'c7ukadeva }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 Gosv\'e4m\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 .
\par The favorable conditions for discharging devotional service are that one should be very enthusiastic in serving the Lord. The Lord in His form of }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid4139932 \'c7r\'e9}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  Caitanya }{
