by the will of the Lord. Therefore, although the living entity is purely conscious in his pure state, he is subordinate to the will of the Lord in being influenced by the external energy of the Lord. In the }{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 Bhagavad}{
\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 -}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid2833115 g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787  also the same thing is confirmed (Bg. 15.15), that the Lord is present within the heart of every living entity,}{\insrsid1641936 
