oly place connected with the Lord}{\i\insrsid1641936\charrsid4592098 ; }{\insrsid1641936\charrsid16332787 and fifth, worshiping the Deity of the Lord with devotion. Such rules and regulations are parts of devotional service. So, as requested by Lord }{
